.SH "struct pdg::PortDrawEvent"
.PP 
\fBPortDrawEvent\fP\&. 

a port needs to be redrawn (\fIGUI Only\fP)

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Documentation-only JavaScript shape, not a runtime constructor\&.
.RE
.PP
 
.PP
\fBFields\fP
.RS 4
Field  Type  Required/default  Meaning  emitter  \fR\fBEventEmitter\fP\fP  Required  eventType  \fRnumber\fP  Required  frameNum  \fRnumber\fP  Required  port  \fR\fBPort\fP\fP  Required  
.RE
.PP
Generated by the \fBGraphicsManager\fP whenever it is time to redraw a \fBPort\fP\&. All drawing calls should be done during the handling of a \fBpdg\&.eventType_PortDraw\fP\&. 
.PP
.nf
{ 
    emitter: {},       // the emitter that generated this event
    eventType: 24,     // the event type (eventType_PortDraw)
    port: {},          // the port that needs to be redrawn
    frameNum: 12897    // how many times this event has been generated for this port
}

.fi
.PP

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
these events are never generated in a non-GUI build, such as the PDG Node\&.js plugin
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBpdg\&.eventType_PortDraw\fP 

.PP
\fBpdg\&.Port\fP 

.PP
\fBpdg\&.GraphicsManager\fP 
.RE
.PP

